Feature: Help and battery
  H (or F1) shows the keys on the view. Press H again or Esc to hide them. If a gamepad is
  connected, H shows a diagram of the gamepad. V installs a new 4S 1800 mAh battery, and the
  BAT reading on the HUD goes back to approximately 100 %.

  Expectation: H shows the help screen
    Given the help screen is hidden
    When the pilot toggles the help
    Then the help screen is shown

  Expectation: H again hides it
    Given the help screen is shown
    When the pilot toggles the help
    Then the help screen is hidden

  Expectation: Esc hides the help screen
    When the pilot closes the help
    Then the help screen is hidden

  Expectation: V fits a fresh battery
    When the pilot fits a fresh battery
    Then the battery is at least 99 %
